# Duckfoot's interface text, in English (en-US). This file is the source: code names a
# message by its id (i18n::tr), and a test fails when it names one missing here. Another
# language is a sibling folder with the same file; any message it lacks falls back to
# these.

## The phone's tabs

tab-library = library
tab-presets = presets
tab-edit = edit
tab-export = export

## The phone's tour

tour-tabs-title = Four tabs
tour-tabs-text = Library, Presets, Edit and Export. Swipe along this bar, or tap a tab, to move on.
tour-choose-title = Choose what to change
tour-choose-text = Swipe up or down on the photo. A list of what this tool changes follows your finger.
tour-adjust-title = Change it
tour-adjust-text = Swipe left or right on the photo. Slowly for fine steps, quickly for big ones.
tour-reset-title = Put it back
tour-reset-text = Double-tap the photo to put that value back where it started.
tour-hold-title = Compare
tour-hold-text = Press and hold the photo to see the original. Let go to see your edit.
tour-strip-title = Change tool
tour-strip-text = Swipe the strip of tools sideways, or tap a name, to change tool.
tour-photo-title = Next photo
tour-photo-text = In the Library, swipe sideways across the photo for the next one.
tour-photo-one = With two or more photos on the shelf, a sideways swipe across the photo moves between them.
tour-needs-photo = Open a photo first: this step is done on it.
tour-end-title = That's it
tour-end-text = Pinch to zoom; FINE makes every change ten times finer. The tour is under Library → ? tour whenever you want it again.
tour-skipped = Tour skipped
tour-again = The tour will show on the next launch
tour-skip = skip
tour-next = Next
tour-done = Done

